description	"Bo-Katan Kryze [Mandalorian] ^3Reworked - Marshall

A quick and versatile Mandalorian with a tough suit of armor. Leans heavier on saber shield combo, but has a small assortment of utility gadgets.

^2Weaponry:

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dual WESTAR-35 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- 15% more FP DMG, 15% more HP DMG
-- 40% slower RoF

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Fuel Regen (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (1)

^3Abilities: 
- Jetpack
- Rocket ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Whistling Birds ^3[CS3]
- Stimpack ^3[CS4]"
